+```bash
+ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_key
+```
+
+**方案 B：OpenRouter**
+
+```bash
+MODEL_PROVIDER=openrouter
+OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_key
+OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
+OPENROUTER_MODEL=openai/gpt-5.4
